graph TD
    User([Meeting Organizer / Member])
    Admin([System Administrator])
    Auditor([Compliance Auditor])

    subgraph Core Platform
        UC1[Upload Audio / Record in Browser]
        UC2[Monitor Processing Stepper via SSE]
        UC3[Interactive Transcript Playback with Click-to-Seek]
        UC4[Inline Transcript & Speaker Editing]
        UC5[Triage & Verify Action Items with Audio Quotes]
        UC6[Export Minutes DOCX/PDF/Markdown/JSON]
    end

    subgraph Administration & Compliance
        UC7[Manage Users & Workspaces RBAC]
        UC8[Configure Data Retention Policy]
        UC9[Inspect Immutable Audit Log]
    end

    User --> UC1
    User --> UC2
    User --> UC3
    User --> UC4
    User --> UC5
    User --> UC6

    Admin --> UC7
    Admin --> UC8
    Admin --> UC9

    Auditor --> UC9
